d the world with one of the most universally beloved bodies of work of all time. Prince’s hit songs ‘Purple Rain’, ‘When Doves Cry’, ‘Kiss’, ‘Raspberry Beret’, and ‘Little Red Corvette’ are just a small sample of his revolutionary blend of rock, funk, R&B and new wave pop that shattered barriers and empowered millions. In the 1980s, Prince made history by being one of the first black artists to have their videos in heavy rotation on MTV. The Prince Estate is proud to present these groundbreaking videos alongside all of Prince’s releases to inspire and educate fans and celebrate Prince in his totality. Subscribe to the channel and check back for new additions, including music videos, performance clips, official Prince playlists, announcements, and more!\n\n#PrinceRogersNelson #Prince #Prince4Ever", "channel_id": "UCv3mNSNjuWldihk1DUdnGtw", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCv3mNSNjuWldihk1DUdnGtw", "duration": 225, "view_count": 141139360, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UG3VcCAlUgE", "categories": ["Music"], "tags": ["Prince", "When Doves Cry", "Purple Rain", "Prince Official", "Prince Rogers Nelson", "The Revolution", "prince when doves cry", "prince when doves cry video", "prince when doves cry official video", "prince blackish", "blackish when doves cry", "jenifer lewis when doves cry", "ruby johnson when doves cry", "prince blackish 100", "Official Prince", "prince videos", "prince music videos", "prince purple rain", "prince music", "prince songs", "when doves cry video", "when doves cry prince"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "comment_count": 32000, "heatmap": [{"start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 2.25, "value": 1.0}, {"start_time": 2.25, "end_time": 4.5, "value": 0.47412997273673013}, {"start_time": 4.5, "end_tim